        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aboluganda, mbeeghembye mwekuumenga abo abaleeta okwawukana n'okutabuka nga batakania ebyo bye mwayegeresebwa. Mubeeghalenga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba abantu abakola ebintu oti n'ebyo tibagheereza Musengwa waife Kurisito aye bakolerera nda dhaibwe. Bakozesa ebibono ebinhoonha era ebisaakiriza, baaguya abantu abazira kabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba obuwulize bwaimwe mu kugondera Amawulire Amalungi bumanhiibwa woonawoona, era kyenva nsangaala ku lwaimwe. Nhenda mubenga bagezi mu kukola ekikalamu aye nga timwidhi kukola kibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni Katonda ensimuko ey'emiraala gyaife, mangu inho aja kutyankirira Sitaani ghansi gh'ebigere byaimwe. Enkabi dha Musengwa waife Yesu Kurisito dhibenga n'imwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
