          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye buti ekyama ekyo kimanhisiibwa mu Byaghandiikibwa abalanzi. Katonda atawaagho yalagira kimanhibwe amaghanga goonagoona, abantu baghange okwikiriza Katonda era n'okumugonderanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Katonda oyo omulala yenka, ate omugezi, agheebwenga ekitiisa mu Yesu Kurisito ebyanda n'ebyanda. Amiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.27",
